    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d729">

                <pb facs="0811" n="691" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg691"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.01 Foreign Control/135: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berne</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-08-17T10:00:00+01:00">August 17, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 17—8:25 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>106. Your 91, August 15, noon.<anchor n="50" xml:id="d729-f1"/> It is definitely
                    anticipated by League Secretariat that the report of the experts who meet today
                    in Geneva cannot be transmitted to the two distant Governments interested, <pb
                        facs="0812" n="692" xml:id="pg692"/> namely, the United States and Liberia,
                    in time to permit the Committee to meet and submit recommendations to the
                    forthcoming session of the Council. It is impossible now to give even an
                    approximate date when the Committee might be convened but the Secretariat sees
                    no probability of such a meeting before the close of the Assembly in
                    September.</p>
                <p>The report will be sent to all members of the Committee and Liberia. The United
                    States and Liberia were mentioned specifically in my 105, August 14, midnight
                        [<hi rendition="#italic">noon</hi>],<anchor n="50a" xml:id="d729-f2"/> to
                    emphasize the time element.</p>
                <p>Such additional information as may be obtained during or directly following the
                    experts’ session will be telegraphed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
